      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "观察和实验是物理知识的源泉."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "要得到科学的知识，还需对实验结果进行思考和解释，找"
      ]
    },
